   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> Bitset <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CORE_01749\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf)\">[SWS_CORE_01749]</a></span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">template &lt;class CharT, class Traits, class Allocator&gt; explicit Bitset (const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_BasicString_b75ad8.html\">BasicString</a>&lt; Allocator &gt; &amp;str, typename <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_BasicString_b75ad8.html#SWS_CORE_03073\">Basic</a> <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_core_ara_core_e30e31.html#SWS_CORE_03001\">String</a>&lt; Allocator &gt;::size_type pos=0, typename <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_BasicString_b75ad8.html\">BasicString</a>&lt; Allocator &gt;::size_type n=<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_BasicString_b75ad8.html\">BasicString</a>&lt; Allocator &gt;::npos, CharT zero=CharT(’0’), CharT one=CharT(’1’)) noexcept;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>As per corresponding usage in [bitset] except for the following deviations: 1. The function is noexcept 2. If (pos &gt; size()), IsoStdOutOfRangeViolation is raised instead of std:: out_of_range 3. If any character is not 1 or 0, IsoStdInvalidArgumentViolation is raised instead of std::invalid_argument 4. Function arguments have been adapted to conform to <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_BasicString_b75ad8.html\">ara::core::BasicString</a> constructor parameters</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
